st and left feedback. The demo has what will be the first tech tier of the game, the Crude tech tier. This will be one of four tech tiers in the final game and you can expect the other tech tiers to include even more things to unlock th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T07:31:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302311","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:05:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4790660-1839041357035232","game_id":"steam-4790660","kind":"announcement","title":"Moose News - Build an efficient solar farm","summary":"Welcome back to Moose News, I’m currently working hard to get the last things done to make the playtest ready for release. While you wait for that, let me tell you how solar power works in the game. The main goal of the game is to build a giant solar farm to power your factory (and maybe something else towards the end game). To get the most out of your solar panels there are a few things you need to account for.Let’s start with the efficiency of the solar panel. The graph below shows the efficie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T09:33:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357035232","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:05:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4790660-1835871199312490","game_id":"steam-4790660","kind":"announcement","title":"Moose News - Merging anything to make it better","summary":"Welcome to Moose News where you’ll get more in depth information about the game as I am getting it ready for release. Today I will describe the merge mechanic in Moose Builders. Everything (with a few exceptions) in the game can be merged by putting 4 of the same item into a Crafter. They will then be merged into 1 of a higher merge tier. There will be 16 merge tiers in the game which means the last merge tiers will be very expensive to craft. The different tiers are displayed with Roman numeral","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T09:34:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199312490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:05:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4790660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:24:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:24:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4790660":"2026-10-26T04:24:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4790660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:24:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:24:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5124910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:24:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:24:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
